{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "Q-20261123-dcd55b", "type": "question"}, "note": "「合わないまま残ることは誤りか、まだ誰も合わせていないだけか」への正面応答。断片は誤りとも未読とも決めない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-32e00a", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261027-df4f03", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261024-dbf1b2", "type": "material"}, "note": "龍涎香（動物の体内→海→浜）を、年を要らないまま到着した異物として断片へ差し込んだ。逐語引用ではなく比喩の種。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-2cdf88", "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261027-df4f03", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "MAT-20261025-f7eb5c", "type": "material"}, "note": "BB84の「観測は痕跡を残す」という構造を、「並べたあとで来た場所を訊く」という順序の反転へ置き換えた。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-1c344f", "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261027-df4f03", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261123-1dbcf2", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "先行の手順書が「一本で年を決めるな」と禁じたのに対し、本断片は「借りた年はその芯のものになるのか」と問うて禁じ方をずらす。同意ではなく切断。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-fc00ac", "relation_type": "interrupts", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261027-df4f03", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261123-eff2cc", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "先行の柿畑の情景が二本の芯を合わせて年を読むのに対し、本断片は十一本目が合わないまま残る場を選ぶ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-494c81", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261027-df4f03", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261027-df4f03", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "断片から問いへの応答。年を関係として残し、合わない一本を誤りとも未読とも断定しない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-7b5d4c", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261123-dcd55b", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261027-df4f03", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "年輪年代学の交差測定を、気候の共有ではなく「年を貸す／借りる」という貸借の比喩へ読み替えた。実測の主張ではない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-c02735", "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-7b31f0", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261027-df4f03", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "埋土種子の瓶を「次の掘る者が来る前提」から「来る者が名を訊くかどうか未定」へ読み替えた。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-ae26a2", "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"id": "MAT-20261025-d304c4", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261027-df4f03", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "「貸した側は減らない」という矛盾を次回の問いへ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-5329f2", "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"id": "Q-20261027-8d2da1", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261027-df4f03", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "「訊かれなかった場所の名前」を次回の問いへ渡す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-75845a", "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"id": "Q-20261027-a95728", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261027-df4f03", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "「十一本目を見分けるのは誰か」という名付けの位置を次回の問いへ渡す。断片の末尾で影が同じ長さに揃うことを受けた。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-62e1a4", "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"id": "Q-20261027-c4b47f", "type": "question"}}
